    },
    {
      "a": "Unused items can be returned within 30 days for a full refund to your E-Wallet or original payment method.",
      "q": "What is the return policy?"
    },
    {
      "a": "Open the wallet from your profile, tap Top Up, choose or key in an amount, and confirm. The balance updates immediately.",
      "q": "How do I top up my E-Wallet?"
    },
    {
      "a": "E-Wallet balance, cards, UPI and cash on delivery, depending on the item.",
      "q": "Which payment methods do you accept?"
